WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.174 --> 00:00:02.827
- So Disney announced
that the character, Lefou,

00:00:02.827 --> 00:00:07.286
in Beauty and the Beast is
gay (sighs and clucks tongue).

00:00:07.286 --> 00:00:09.126
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.126 --> 00:00:10.758
If I can't sit through a movie

00:00:10.758 --> 00:00:13.067
with God or Jesus sitting by me,

00:00:13.067 --> 00:00:14.813
then I don't got no business showing it.

00:00:14.813 --> 00:00:16.366
Outside of the liberal media,

00:00:16.366 --> 00:00:18.593
a lot of good folk are commending me

00:00:18.593 --> 00:00:20.238
on my stance to ban this movie

00:00:20.238 --> 00:00:22.035
so I thought I'd take this opportunity

00:00:22.035 --> 00:00:24.575
to let people know about the
other films I've wanted to ban.

00:00:24.575 --> 00:00:26.647
We'll start at the top,
obviously Harry Potter,

00:00:26.647 --> 00:00:27.878
cannot show that film.

00:00:27.878 --> 00:00:29.918
Witchcraft has no place in any school.

00:00:29.918 --> 00:00:31.268
Moana, had to ban it.

00:00:31.268 --> 00:00:32.305
Ocean ain't no person,

00:00:32.305 --> 00:00:33.384
mountains ain't no lady.

00:00:33.384 --> 00:00:35.050
Zootopia, also Disney.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.297
Gazelles aren't that sexy,

00:00:36.297 --> 00:00:38.207
animals shouldn't be depicted so sexy.

00:00:38.207 --> 00:00:39.040
Jurassic Park.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.869
The earth is only 3,000 years old.

00:00:40.869 --> 00:00:42.797
All of those bones were
just planted by the devil.

00:00:42.797 --> 00:00:46.059
Star Wars, ain't nothing in
the stars besides heaven.

00:00:46.059 --> 00:00:48.851
Frozen, witches.

00:00:48.851 --> 00:00:49.684
Banned it.

00:00:49.684 --> 00:00:51.626
Lion King, again, Disney.

00:00:51.626 --> 00:00:53.759
Teaching kids to run
away from their family,

00:00:53.759 --> 00:00:55.566
hang out with a bunch
of gays in the woods,

00:00:55.566 --> 00:00:57.080
have premarital sex, then come back

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:58.299
and you can be king?

00:00:58.299 --> 00:00:59.721
How the Grinch Stole Christmas,

00:00:59.721 --> 00:01:03.888
not one mention of Jesus
Christ in a Christmas movie.

00:01:04.792 --> 00:01:05.625
I'm gettin' too fired up.

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:08.375
Toy Story, I had to ban that
one because of communism.

00:01:08.375 --> 00:01:10.672
You can't be born into an
occupation you can't get out of,

00:01:10.672 --> 00:01:11.720
I just can't support that.

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:13.873
Tried to show Moonlight,
people said it was important.

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:15.824
(laughs) That was a mistake.

00:01:15.824 --> 00:01:17.803
Shrek Forever After, had to ban it.

00:01:17.803 --> 00:01:19.123
They should have stopped after three.

00:01:19.123 --> 00:01:20.639
It was a perfect trilogy, really.

00:01:20.639 --> 00:01:22.439
Juno, I liked that
movie, she kept the baby,

00:01:22.439 --> 00:01:23.848
that's the right thing to do.

00:01:23.848 --> 00:01:25.608
Had to ban it because
they gave her a choice.

00:01:25.608 --> 00:01:27.669
Pocahontas, demonizing humans.

00:01:27.669 --> 00:01:30.891
Monsters, Inc. humanizing demons.

00:01:30.891 --> 00:01:31.724
Banned.

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:33.532
Dog's Purpose, like I wanna show

00:01:33.532 --> 00:01:36.952
a movie about reincarnation
and animals having souls.

00:01:36.952 --> 00:01:38.315
No thank you, next!

00:01:38.315 --> 00:01:42.350
Mad Max, presenting this idea
that all these fossil fuels

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:44.727
will lead to some sort
of desolate landscape.

00:01:44.727 --> 00:01:46.189
Yeah, that's real, that's real.

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:47.823
Planet of the Apes, I
don't wanna get started

00:01:47.823 --> 00:01:49.853
about this movie, but I'm gonna have to.

00:01:49.853 --> 00:01:52.304
People think that humans
came from monkeys.

00:01:52.304 --> 00:01:54.588
Look at a monkey and look at me.

00:01:54.588 --> 00:01:57.180
Do you think I look like a monkey?

00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:58.054
No, sir.

00:01:58.054 --> 00:01:59.352
No, sir.

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:01.740
Finding Dory, you can
find another theater.

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:03.650
Good luck finding one.

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:04.483
Get Out.

00:02:07.624 --> 00:02:08.648
No, sir.

00:02:08.648 --> 00:02:11.127
Great Wall, now see I thought that one

00:02:11.127 --> 00:02:13.189
was gonna be about the important wall,

00:02:13.189 --> 00:02:15.893
but it turns out it's about
Matt Damon with a ponytail

00:02:15.893 --> 00:02:18.705
save the Chinese from lizard people.

00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:20.808
Good movie, I didn't band that one.

00:02:20.808 --> 00:02:21.824
I like Matt Damon.

